# Gum Nebula

id:world-gum-nebula a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Gum Nebula" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/4da02c3e5907f> ;
    oa:kind "volume" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "Reaches from Sophic League territory into the Non-Coercive Zone, with enclaves of the Diamond Network, many Stellar Umma worlds and the Vela Immunity inside it — five claimants, more than any other entry here." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

